# Salesforce trademark — deployed to the org, deliberately not redistributed here.
# Supply your own via Bingo_Event__mdt.Logo_Url__c (a static resource path such as
# /sfsites/c/resource/YourLogo avoids the Experience Cloud CSP entirely).
force-app/main/default/staticresources/SalesforceLogo.png

# Raw per-claim log: who named whom, when, for which prompt — 356 rows of
# attendee behaviour. Players consented to a display name on a leaderboard, not
# to a permanent public dataset of their connections. The derived network.json
# (names + edges, no timestamps) is published instead, and matches what the
# shared image already shows. Regenerate locally with analysis/shape.js.
analysis/graph.json
